\title{Capability and evidence about a recorded run}
\tag{ftip}

\p{Capability is evaluated under a declared intervention and task law, as in \ref{ftip-0003}. Satisfying the evidence contracts for one recorded run gives the narrower conclusion in \ref{ftip-00HZ}.}
